Hosek-Wilkie sky model coefficients in src/hosek_wilkie.npy: the RGB dataset of the sample implementation of
"An Analytic Model for Full Spectral Sky-Dome Radiance" (SIGGRAPH 2012) and "Adding a Solar Radiance Function to the
Hosek Skylight Model" (IEEE CG&A 2013), version 1.4a, as float32 of shape (3, 2, 10, 10, 6): channel (R, G, B),
ground albedo (0, 1), turbidity (1 to 10), coefficient (A to I, then the radiance) and Bezier control point.

